    CASE 0
        PRINTFORML Having aided them with their pranks, the fairies no longer appear to be distrustful of you.
        PRINTFORML You are no longer considered to be [%GET_TALENTNAME_TR(GETNUM(TALENT, "FAIRY_FRIEND"), -1, MASTER)%].
